---
layout: page.njk
title: Roofing Project Gallery
seoTitle: Roofing Project Gallery | Juneau Odenwald Roofing
description: Photos of commercial, historic and residential roofing projects by Juneau Odenwald Roofing in New Orleans, Metairie and across Louisiana.
h1: Project Gallery
lede: Commercial, historic and residential roofs we've installed and restored around New Orleans.
hero: 2022-12-aerial9mls-5.webp
permalink: /gallery/
---
<section class="band">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="card-grid">
      {%- for p in projects %}{% if p.thumb %}
      <a class="card card--link card--sm" href="{{ p.url }}">
        <span class="card__img"><img src="/images/{{ p.thumb.file }}" alt="{{ p.name }}" width="{{ p.thumb.w }}" height="{{ p.thumb.h }}" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></span>
        <span class="card__body"><h3>{{ p.name }}</h3><p>{{ p.images.length }} photos</p></span>
      </a>
      {%- endif %}{% endfor %}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
